Z||000007||Indiana_resto_guy||10-16-2001||09:53 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cheever3000:<BR><B>Is the bottom edge of the door (on the white notchback) really that much "off", or is it just a shadow over-pronounced by the camera angle?  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Good camera angle, it's that much off. But it's not off that far that body, it will look better after it gets realigned. I'm not sure as yet where the proper adjustment will be at but the doors were off of it for paint. It may turn out not to be the door but the rocker alignment, it may be under some stress. Then again the door may not have been fully closed either, I can't remember!<BR>||||reg||1
